listing:   tshark on cap.pcap of the forensic run
toolchain: TShark (Wireshark) 4.2.2 (Git v4.2.2 packaged as 4.2.2-1.1build3).
command:   tshark -r cap.pcap -Y 'tcp.port == 9 and tcp.analysis.*'; -T fields -e frame.number -e frame.time_relative -e ip.src -e tcp.flags.str -e tcp.seq -e tcp.len -e tcp.ack -e _ws.expert.message
date:      2026-10-09T22:41:20Z
machine:   Linux x86_64 (cloud build container)
exit code: 0
